<title>MEXICO: Bufete subsidiary wins contract in Chile.</title>
<headline>Bufete subsidiary wins contract in Chile.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican construction company Bufete Industrial SA said on Wednesday that its subsidiary in Chile won a $10.5 million contract.</p>
<p>Bufete said in a statement that its Chilean unit, Empresa de Obras y Montajes Ovalle, Moore, SA, will build a cement plant and install the needed equipment for Cementos Bio-Bio SA in Teno.</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565</p>
